  "prefLabel": "Ph 810.03 Excess Continuing Education Requirements for Certified Pharmacy Technicians",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 810.03 Excess Continuing Education Requirements for Certified Pharmacy Technicians. Excess continuing education units earned in one licensure period shall not be carried forward into the new licensure period for the purpose of fulfilling that year’s continuing education prerequisite for licensure renewal.\n\nSource. #12671, eff 11-17-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
